WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:12.792
Stan laughed. "I told you I could help!"

2
00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:18.729
Cora shook her head. "No way!

3
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.795
Stay here with Mo."

4
00:00:21.796 --> 00:00:28.961
Cora dashed away.

5
00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.764
"I can do this alone!" she thought.

6
00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:37.009
"I'll find the sharks and stop them."

7
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:42.613
Suddenly the arrow shot in front of Cora.

8
00:00:42.614 --> 00:00:46.491
It pointed back at the reef.

9
00:00:46.492 --> 00:00:53.373
Cora shook her head and kept swimming.

10
00:00:53.374 --> 00:00:59.681
The arrow swam after her.

11
00:00:59.682 --> 00:01:02.805
Soon Cora saw two shadows.

12
00:01:02.806 --> 00:01:05.951
"The whitetips!" Cora thought.

13
00:01:05.952 --> 00:01:10.818
"I'll show Stan."

14
00:01:10.819 --> 00:01:14.202
"Hey, sharks!" Cora cried.

15
00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:19.709
"Leave Rainbow Reef alone!"

16
00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.830
The sharks looked at her.

17
00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:27.937
Their teeth were white and sharp.

18
00:01:27.938 --> 00:01:31.809
They swam toward her—faster and faster!

19
00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:37.355
Whoosh! Cora sprayed her dark ink.

20
00:01:37.356 --> 00:01:41.740
But the sharks didn't stop!

21
00:01:41.741 --> 00:01:44.617
Cora zoomed away.

22
00:01:44.618 --> 00:01:49.011
The sharks chased her!

23
00:01:49.012 --> 00:01:54.158
Cora zigged and zagged.

24
00:01:54.159 --> 00:02:01.766
The sharks snapped their teeth.

25
00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:05.628
Finally Cora saw a boulder ahead.

26
00:02:05.629 --> 00:02:09.798
She squeezed herself underneath it.

27
00:02:09.799 --> 00:02:12.478
Snap! Snap!

28
00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:16.667
The sharks' big mouths couldn't reach her!

29
00:02:16.668 --> 00:02:20.379
"Phew!" Cora thought.

30
00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:29.252
Finally the sharks swam away.

31
00:02:29.253 --> 00:02:32.847
But they were heading toward Rainbow Reef.

32
00:02:32.848 --> 00:02:39.960
Cora sighed. "Maybe I do need help!"

